Your own kernel parameters go into *.conf files in this folder, for example
50-local.conf with:

    amdgpu.ppfeaturemask=0xffffffff

They are added after Lunar's parameters, so they win when a parameter
appears twice. To leave out Lunar's parameters entirely, set
LUNAR_DEFAULTS=no in /etc/lunar/cmdline.conf.

Apply with:  sudo lunar-update-cmdline   (then reboot)
A kernel update applies them too.
